Cover WM event deadlines while held or awaiting an acknowledgement

A complete retained event remains available after twenty simulated seconds. A partial event retains its original deadline while an ack reply is withheld and additional bytes arrive, then closes at that exact deadline.

Validation: strict WITH_IPC=0 make check. These are scripted clock controls, with no real-time or production Session claim.
